Fills today:
<% if brief.fills_today.nil? -%>
  unknown: the activities feed is stale (last sync <%= stamp(brief.account&.last_sync(:activities)) %>)
<% elsif brief.fills_today.none? -%>
  none
<% end -%>
<% (brief.fills_today || []).each do |fill| -%>
  <%= fill.side %> <%= quantity(fill.quantity) %> <%= fill.instrument.symbol %> @ <%= money(fill.price) %> (<%= stamp(fill.executed_at) %>)
<% end -%>

Journal rows touched today:
<% if brief.trades_touched_today.nil? -%>
  unknown: the activities feed is stale
<% elsif brief.trades_touched_today.none? -%>
  none
<% end -%>
<% (brief.trades_touched_today || []).each do |trade| -%>
  <%= trade.instrument.symbol %> <%= trade.status %><%= " · needs review" if trade.needs_review? %> <%= trade_url(trade) %>
<% end -%>

Missing post-mortems:
<% if brief.missing_post_mortems.none? -%>
  none
<% end -%>
<% brief.missing_post_mortems.each do |trade| -%>
  <%= trade.instrument.symbol %> closed <%= stamp(trade.closed_at) %> <%= r_multiple(trade) %> <%= trade_url(trade) %>
<% end -%>
<% if brief.more_post_mortems > 0 -%>
  and <%= brief.more_post_mortems %> more: <%= trades_url(filter: "missing_post_mortem") %>
<% end -%>

<% if brief.stop_suggestions.any? -%>
Tighten stop (the latest trails; suggestion only):
<% brief.stop_suggestions.each do |position| -%>
  <%= position.instrument.symbol %>: <%= position.suggested_stop_method %> trail <%= money(position.stop_suggestion) %> vs working stop <%= position.stop_price ? money(position.stop_price) : "none" %>
<% end -%>

<% end -%>
<% if brief.snapshot -%>
Snapshot <%= brief.snapshot.as_of %>: equity <%= money(brief.snapshot.equity) %>, drawdown <%= percent(brief.snapshot.drawdown) %>, open risk <%= brief.snapshot.open_risk_amount ? money(brief.snapshot.open_risk_amount) : "unknown" %>, unprotected <%= brief.snapshot.unprotected_count %>
<% elsif brief.balance -%>
Today's snapshot is not yet written; equity <%= money(brief.balance.equity) %> as of <%= stamp(brief.balance.as_of) %><%= " (stale)" if brief.balance_stale? %>
<% else -%>
No balance has synced yet.
<% end -%>
